\"2. Forgetting That Online Purchases May Be Taxed\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"3-assuming-groceries-are-always-tax-free\",\"text\":\"3. Assuming Groceries Are Always Tax-Free\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"4-not-taking-advantage-of-sales-tax-holidays\",\"text\":\"4. Not Taking Advantage of Sales Tax Holidays\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"5-miscalculating-reverse-sales-tax\",\"text\":\"5. Miscalculating Reverse Sales Tax\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"frequently-asked-questions\",\"text\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"what-state-has-the-highest-sales-tax\",\"text\":\"What state has the highest sales tax?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"what-state-has-the-lowest-sales-tax\",\"text\":\"What state has the lowest sales tax?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"do-i-have-to-pay-sales-tax-on-online-purchases\",\"text\":\"Do I have to pay sales tax on online purchases?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"what-is-the-difference-between-sales-tax-and-use-tax\",\"text\":\"What is the difference between sales tax and use tax?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"are-groceries-tax-free\",\"text\":\"Are groceries tax-free?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-do-i-find-my-exact-sales-tax-rate\",\"text\":\"How do I find my exact sales tax rate?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"do-i-need-to-collect-sales-tax-if-i-sell-online\",\"text\":\"Do I need to collect sales tax if I sell online?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"is-clothing-tax-free\",\"text\":\"Is clothing tax-free?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"can-sales-tax-rates-change-during-the-year\",\"text\":\"Can sales tax rates change during the year?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"what-is-a-sales-tax-holiday\",\"text\":\"What is a sales tax holiday?\",\"level\":3}]}]}]}],\"$L29\"]}],\"$L2a\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\"