 wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/sales-tax-by-state-guide-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Sales Tax by State: Complete Guide to US Tax Rates in 2026\",\"description\":\"Complete guide to sales tax rates for all 50 US states in 2026. State rates, local rates, combined rates, tax-exempt items, and how to calculate sales tax. Free calculator included.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/sales-tax-by-state-guide-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/sales-tax-by-state-guide-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"sales tax\",\"state sales tax\",\"sales tax rates\",\"sales tax calculator\",\"tax by state\",\"2026\"],\"wordCount\":4326,\"articleSection\":\"Tax Guide\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/sales-tax-by-state-guide-2026#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Sales Tax by State: Complete Guide to US Tax Rates in 2026\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/sales-tax-by-state-guid